rule.docs:
Summary

- Name: noExtraBooleanCast
- Fix: safe
- Default severity: info
- Available from version: 1.0.0
- Diagnostic category: lint/complexity/noExtraBooleanCast
- This rule is recommended

Description

 Disallow unnecessary boolean casts

Examples

Invalid

 ```js,expect_diagnostic
 if (!Boolean(foo)) {
 }
 ```

 ```js,expect_diagnostic
 while (!!foo) {}
 ```

 ```js,expect_diagnostic
 let x = 1;
 do {
 1 + 1;
 } while (Boolean(x));
 ```

 ```js,expect_diagnostic
 for (; !!foo; ) {}
 ```

 ```js,expect_diagnostic
 new Boolean(!!x);
 ```

Valid
 ```js
 Boolean(!x);
 !x;
 !!x;
 ```

